    "Real casts and CMSG_CANCEL_AURA exercise native handlers, without fixture aura removal.",
    "Incoming damage metrics query native bonuses without dealing damage; damage-break behavior is outside scope.",
    "With regeneration disabled and zero starting mana, power must equal logged gains after cancel and remain stable."
  ],
